ourairports.json: two facts per airport, by IATA code, derived from OurAirports' airports.csv
(https://ourairports.com/data/airports.csv), downloaded 2026-10-27, sha256
27c6500d0a742edece15c5aaf960e08c01df0d4356c5c86255897b5d3749ad3b. OurAirports releases its data into the public domain
(https://ourairports.com/data/).
Changes: only the `type` (as large, medium, small or other) and `scheduled_service` of the rows whose `iata_code` is
in airports.2026-10-01-a89e4e0.json were kept; a code on several rows takes the larger type, then scheduled service.
Built by packages/db/scripts/build-airports.mjs --ourairports. The CSV itself is not in the repository.
